#~ msgid "Collision / Interaction Shape"
#~ msgstr "碰撞/交互形状"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Collision Shape**: Defines the physical "
#~ "boundaries of a block that entities "
#~ "cannot pass through. It determines where"
#~ " an entity will stop when moving "
#~ "towards the block."
#~ msgstr "**碰撞形状（collision_shape）**：实体无法穿过的方块的物理边界，决定实体在靠近方块时会被阻挡在什么位置。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Interaction Shape**: Defines the area "
#~ "where the player can interact with "
#~ "or break the block. This includes "
#~ "actions such as right-clicking to "
#~ "open a GUI (e.g., chests, furnaces) "
#~ "or mining the block. Some blocks "
#~ "have an interaction shape but no "
#~ "collision, such as crops or scaffolding."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**交互形状（interaction_shape）**：玩家可以与方块交互或破坏的区域。这包括右键打开 "
#~ "GUI（如箱子、熔炉）或采掘方块等操作。有些方块有交互形状但没有碰撞，比如农作物或脚手架。"

